text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HuhYou {
    "Huh?\n"
    "You…$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YourePlayerWereYourFansNow {
    "Are you maybe…\n"
    "… …\p"
    "You are!\n"
    "You are {PLAYER}!\p"
    "We were just talking about you!\p"
    "We were talking about how an\n"
    "incredibly good TRAINER appeared.\p"
    "And that someone is you!\n"
    "You're so cool!\p"
    "So, we decided that we'll become\n"
    "your FAN CLUB!\p"
    "We all hope you'll keep battling\n"
    "and show us how cool you are.\p"
    "That way, maybe other people will\n"
    "become fans just like me.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_AlwaysCheerForYou {
    "I'll always be cheering for you!\p"
    "Go, {PLAYER}, go!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_IllAlwaysBelieveInYou {
    "I'll always believe in you,\n"
    "{PLAYER}.\p"
    "Please show the others what you're\n"
    "like when you battle seriously.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WasYourFanNotAnymore {
    "I'm sorry.\n"
    "I was your fan before.\p"
    "But now, you seem to have lost\n"
    "the drive you had before.\p"
    "Lately, I think {STR_VAR_1} has been\n"
    "a lot cooler.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_EveryonesYourFanButICantBe {
    "Oh!\n"
    "{PLAYER}!\p"
    "Everyone's been all excited about\n"
    "you recently.\p"
    "I can understand why.\n"
    "I know that you're strong.\p"
    "But, do you know what?\p"
    "Once I became {STR_VAR_1}'s fan,\n"
    "I can't just stop being a fan.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TrainersCoolWhenBattling {
    "I think TRAINERS are so cool when\n"
    "they're battling.\p"
    "Don't you think so, too?$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_CanYouAutographShorts {
    "Oh! It's {PLAYER}!\n"
    "Too cool!\p"
    "Oh!\n"
    "Oh, yeah!\p"
    "Can you autograph something?\n"
    "How about my shorts?$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_CountingOnYou {
    "However hot it's been…\p"
    "And however cold it may get…\p"
    "I've always believed in, and worn,\n"
    "shorts!\p"
    "I'm counting on you to keep\n"
    "winning!\p"
    "I believe in you just as much as\n"
    "I believe in shorts!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_BrocksMyHero {
    "BROCK's my hero!\n"
    "He's a man among men!\p"
    "Heheh, I got my mom to do\n"
    "something for me.\p"
    "I got her to embroider “BROCK”\n"
    "on my shorts!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_BrocksFanToBitterEnd {
    "…  …\p"
    "…  …\n"
    "I'm BROCK's fan!\p"
    "Even if I were his only fan,\n"
    "I swear it on my rock-hard will,\l"
    "and on my shorts!\p"
    "I'll be his fan to the bitter end!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_BrocksLastWordOnCool {
    "BROCK's the last word on cool,\n"
    "end of story!\p"
    "Now there's a guy who I want to\n"
    "be like!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HadPleasureOfWatchingYouBattle {
    "{PLAYER}, I've had the pleasure of\n"
    "watching you battle.\p"
    "It brings back sweet memories of\n"
    "my own long-lost youth.\p"
    "May you continue to find success.\n"
    "You have a fan in me!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_NeverSeenTrainerOfYourMagnificence {
    "I have journeyed far and wide\n"
    "across the lands.\p"
    "But never have I seen a TRAINER\n"
    "of your magnificence.\p"
    "Take courage in your abilities\n"
    "and keep battling on!\p"
    "Make that a promise to me,\n"
    "my young idol!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_HmmAndYouAre {
    "Hmm…\n"
    "And you are?\p"
    "Were you hoping to sign up for\n"
    "a membership in our FAN CLUB?$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YouveStillAWaysToGo {
    "Ah, so you are the much-\n"
    "talked-about {PLAYER}.\p"
    "You certainly do have the look of\n"
    "a winner.\p"
    "But for me to accept you as\n"
    "a true POKéMON great…\p"
    "… …\p"
    "You've still a ways to go!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_YoullBeTalkedAboutIfYouKeepWinning {
    "All of us gathered here are fans\n"
    "of POKéMON TRAINERS.\p"
    "The way they look in battle…\n"
    "They are the picture of coolness.\p"
    "Perhaps you will be talked about\n"
    "here, too, if you keep winning.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WantToBeLikeYouOneDay {
    "It's {PLAYER}!\n"
    "It's {PLAYER}!\p"
    "I want to be like {PLAYER} one day!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_EveryoneButMeStoppedBeingYourFan {
    "Everyone stopped being {PLAYER}'s\n"
    "fan…\p"
    "But that means I can have {PLAYER}\n"
    "all to myself!\p"
    "Yay! Go for it!\n"
    "My one and only {PLAYER}!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_WantToBeLikeSabrina {
    "Do you know what?\n"
    "I want to be like SABRINA!\p"
    "I want to be a psychic girl just\n"
