}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_TheWayYouBattleIsCool {
    "Oh, man, oh, man!\n"
    "Cool! Too cool!\p"
    "…Huh?\n"
    "No, not you.\p"
    "Just the way you battle.\n"
    "That's cool.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ImOnlyOneLeftOfYourFans {
    "Yo, {PLAYER}!\p"
    "Looks like I'm the only one left\n"
    "out of your fans.\p"
    "But, you know, I like being an only\n"
    "fan… It's less stressful.\p"
    "Keep up and at it!$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_LoveWayTrainerTalks {
    "{STR_VAR_1}'s cool, huh?\n"
    "I love the way he talks.\p"
    "I'd really relish a chance to meet\n"
