}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_ImLoneTrainerFan {
    "Huh, can you believe it?\n"
    "Everyone turned into your fans.\p"
    "So after all we've been through,\n"
    "I'm the lone {STR_VAR_1} fan?\p"
    "Eh, being the one and only\n"
    "{STR_VAR_1} fan's my style, anyway.$"
}

text SaffronCity_PokemonTrainerFanClub_Text_AdoreWayYouBattle {
    "Oh, my goodness!\n"
